{"title":"Career Roadmap · Siddha Medicine Researcher","role":"Siddha Medicine Researcher","summary":"A Siddha Medicine Researcher conducts scientific, clinical, pharmacological, pharmaceutical, public-health, or documentation-based research related to Siddha medicine and its traditional knowledge systems.","facts":{"Current degree":"BSMS (Siddha)","Course":"Siddha Medicine & Surgery"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Siddha Medicine Researcher conducts scientific, clinical, pharmacological, pharmaceutical, public-health, or documentation-based research related to Siddha medicine and its traditional knowledge systems."},{"type":"p","text":"A BSMS graduate can develop toward research in areas such as:"},{"type":"h","text":"Siddha pharmacology"},{"type":"h","text":"Medicinal plants"},{"type":"h","text":"Traditional formulations"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacognosy"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacology and toxicology"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical research"},{"type":"h","text":"Drug standardization"},{"type":"h","text":"Quality control"},{"type":"h","text":"Public health"},{"type":"h","text":"Evidence-based Siddha medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"Traditional knowledge documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Integrative medicine research"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital health and research analytics"},{"type":"flow","items":["The strongest modern profile combines Siddha knowledge","scientific research methodology","data analysis","evidence-based practice."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"Clinical practice and research are different career tracks. A BSMS graduate should follow applicable professional registration and research-ethics requirements. Clinical research involving human participants requires appropriate institutional ethics oversight and applicable regulatory compliance."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"BSMS"},{"type"