erence presentations"},{"type":"h","text":"Systematic reviews"},{"type":"h","text":"Research collaborations"},{"type":"h","text":"Grants/projects"},{"type":"h","text":"Patents where genuinely applicable"},{"type":"p","text":"Quality and methodological rigor are more important than simply increasing publication count."}]},{"heading":"AI & Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"AI-Assisted Literature Review"},{"type":"h","text":"AI can help researchers:"},{"type":"h","text":"Organize literature"},{"type":"h","text":"Extract themes"},{"type":"h","text":"Compare studies"},{"type":"h","text":"Identify research gaps"},{"type":"h","text":"Summarize papers"},{"type":"p","text":"However, researchers must verify claims against the original papers."},{"type":"h","text":"Bioinformatics & Computational Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Where relevant, students can explore:"},{"type":"h","text":"Molecular docking"},{"type":"h","text":"Computational drug discovery"},{"type":"h","text":"Network pharmacology"},{"type":"h","text":"Molecular databases"},{"type":"h","text":"Systems biology"},{"type":"p","text":"These require additional training beyond the BSMS curriculum."},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Clinical Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging areas include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Electronic health records"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical research databases"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital biomarkers"},{"type":"h","text":"Remote monitoring"},{"type":"h","text":"Real-world data"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-Based Data Analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Research Dataset"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Cleaning"},{"type":"h","text":"Statistical Analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Machine Learning"},{"type":"h","text":"Pattern Detection"},{"type":"h","text":"Research Interpretation"},{"type":"p","text":"AI/ML findings should be validated and interpreted scientifically rather than treated as proof of clinical effectiveness."}]},{"heading":"Target Profile at Graduation","kind":"other"